version     = "0.1.0"
author      = "daveey"
description = "Trick-Taking: one engine, four rule modules, no talking allowed. Euchre, Spades, Hearts and Oh Hell for four LLM-piloted cogs on the Softmax Coworld platform; a policy is just a prompt."
